{"resourceIdentifier":"2744","resourceName":"The Paraguayan Chaco Neem Reforestation Project","description":"The Paraguayan Chaco Neem Reforestation Project is located in the dry savannah of the Gran Chaco, a region famous for its dry and hostile conditions. The region is traditionally used for livestock, having its vegetation cover suppressed over the years. Thus, the purpose of the present grouped ARR project is the\r\nreforestation of a region within Paraguay’s Gran Chaco, in Boquerón. This will be achieved through the recovery of deforested and/or degraded forests, with the planting of native or exotic species.","location":{"latitude":-21.071081,"longitude":-60.262089},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2022-04-07","endExclusive":"2022-05-08","endInclusive":"2022-05-07"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"2744"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Boqueron"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"El Retiro S.A."},{"type":"string","value":"Boquerón, Paraguay"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"2744"},{"type":"bufferSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"2744"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"12211"}]},{"code":"TOTAL_BUFFER_POOL_CREDITS","values":[{"type":"integer","value":1829}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Agriculture Forestry and Other Land Use"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_SUBCATERGORY_NAMES","values":[{"type":"string","value":"ARR"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AR-AMS0007"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_ACREAGE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"7000 Hectares"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"RINA Services S.p.A"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE"